notes.body:
It seems that the specification allows such case in which multiple messages are concatenated in a single frame:
![image](/uploads/1b1f1783695d4b378c5c4f73422b67fd/image.png){width=866 height=426}

I will align the code to increase the offset in the erroneous cases.

